     "title": "Anthropic 祭出全新治理架构：重新定义 AI 公司的资本规则",
     "link": "https://www.huxiu.com/article/4899573.html?f=rss",
     "pubDate": "Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:52:21 +0800",
